    "detailed_description": "&quot;Silent Station&quot; is a social, psychological, multiplayer game based on the rules of the classic mafia, complemented by the features of setting death traps.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292980/extras/ef25cc73dc60b11b4468195efbb66e90.poster.avif?t=1693218268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292980/extras/ef25cc73dc60b11b4468195efbb66e90.webm?t=1693218268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292980/extras/ef25cc73dc60b11b4468195efbb66e90.mp4?t=1693218268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The rules are simple: there is a crew, there is a traitor.<br>The crew goal is to figure out the traitor and throw him out into space or complete all the tasks at the spaceship.<br><br>The traitor, on the other hand, can set death traps in advance or directly eliminate crew members.<br>(!) Block the door right in front of the victim's nose!<br>(!) Turn, initially peaceful crew members, into your monstermates!<br>(!) Hide bodies by breaking the spaceship lighting!<br>(!) Launch the self-destruct system!<br><br>All this awaits you at the &quot;Silent Station&quot;!",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Silent Station&quot; is a social, psychological, multiplayer game based on the rules of the classic mafia, complemented by the features of setting death traps.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292980/extras/ef25cc73dc60b11b4468195efbb66e90.poster.avif?t=1693218268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292980/extras/ef25cc73dc60b11b4468195efbb66e90.webm?t=1693218268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292980/extras/ef25cc73dc60b11b4468195efbb66e90.mp4?t=1693218268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The rules are simple: there is a crew, there is a traitor.<br>The crew goal is to figure out the traitor and throw him out into space or complete all the tasks at the spaceship.<br><br>The traitor, on the other hand, can set death traps in advance or directly eliminate crew members.<br>(!) Block the door right in front of the victim's nose!<br>(!) Turn, initially peaceful crew members, into your monstermates!<br>(!) Hide bodies by breaking the spaceship lighting!<br>(!) Launch the self-destruct system!<br><br>All this awaits you at the &quot;Silent Station&quot;!",
    "short_description": "Deceive your friends and throw them into space, prepare deadly traps or figure out an impostor. Here you will learn how to cheat and use deduction. The game is well suited for companies of 6-12 people. The full range of emotions is guaranteed! Buy for friends as a gift!",
